  "scope": "Both normal and deadline-limited gameplay generation drains check physical output at terrain saturation. A ready buffer that writes a cold block, explicit light, light section or weather section keeps its owner. Existing-only peers can still apply. Whole results starting below the threshold preserve every cross-column write. With a fixed threshold T and a direct output horizon W, one such buffer can raise residency to T minus one plus W. Later adding buffers wait until residency falls below T. The control at full capacity adds four columns without the gate. The held exact successor publishes after space becomes available.",
  "remaining": "Compose the numeric maximum output footprint for supported world data and the synchronous, cooperative, direct edit and record-only owners. The generation buffer budget can grow for a valid isolated job. Prove progress with every generation result owner occupied and join the disk index and registry. The supplementary route and startup evidence leave the full movement, outer-ring, cave, wet, visual and performance matrix open. Full S0-S6 acceptance remains open at 23 of 42 packages.",
